    "semantic_summary": "AppComponent serves as the root controller for the graph visualization application, managing the entire lifecycle from data ingestion to display. It orchestrates data fetching from local or API sources, normalizes the payload, and utilizes GraphHierarchyService to build cluster groups. It integrates GraphViewportComponent for rendering and GraphInspectorComponent for user interaction, synchronizing state via GraphStateService."
